      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-293729",
      ":question/problem": "A travel agency modeled the number of bookings $B$ for a particular tour as a linear function of the tour price. There were $480$ bookings when the price was $$800$, and $360$ bookings when the price was $$1,000$. Based on this model, what tour price would result in $420$ bookings?\n\n*Hint: Let the tour price be represented by the variable $p$.*"
